OL,3,GNEWSAStudent describes agony of MenB as
OL,4,Ajabs rolled out
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo far, nearly 6,500 doses of the MenB
OL,7,Fvaccine have been given to young people
OL,8,Facross Somerset, Wiltshire,
OL,9,FGloucestershire and Bristol as part of
OL,10,Fa "one-off" NHS vaccination programme
OL,11,Flaunched this summer.
OL,13,FMatthew Dominey, from NHS England South
OL,14,FWest, said: "MenB can be
OL,15,Flife-threatening, so it is vital that
OL,16,Fthose eligible take up the offer of
OL,17,Fgetting vaccinated."
